# Sanitizer and fuzzer output.  /obj/ already covers obj/asan, obj/fuzzlib
# and obj/fuzz, which is where `make asan` and `make fuzz` put everything;
# these catch corpora or crash artefacts written by hand elsewhere.
/fuzz/corpus/
crash-*
leak-*
timeout-*
oom-*
